<title>GERMANY: German May 6-mo annualised M3 up 7.2 pct (6.4 pct).</title>
<headline>German May 6-mo annualised M3 up 7.2 pct (6.4 pct).</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank on Friday provided the following seasonally-adjusted and annualised six-month money supply growth rates in percent:</p>
<p>						     May	   April</p>
<p>    M3 money supply			    7.2  vs     6.4</p>
<p>    Loans to the private sector	    8.7  vs     8.5</p>
<p>    Money capital formation		  4.0  vs     4.4</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
